1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,400
What evidence is there of a ghost?
有什么证据表明有鬼？

2
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,770
What evidence is there of a ghost?
有什么证据表明有鬼？

3
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:27,010
A public house which was recently bought by Mr.Ian Thompson is up for sale.
伊恩·汤普森先生最近买下的一家小酒馆现在要出售。

4
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:32,300
Mr.Thompson is going to sell it because it is haunted.
汤普森先生打算卖掉它，因为这里闹鬼。

5
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:37,730
He told me that he could not go to sleep one night
他告诉我有天晚上他睡不着，

6
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:41,790
because he heard a strange noise coming from the bar.
因为他听到酒吧里传出奇怪的声音。

7
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,410
The next morning,
第二天早上，

8
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:50,830
he found that the doors had been blocked by chairs and the furniture had been moved.
他发现门被椅子堵住了，家具也被挪动过。

9
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:57,140
Though Mr.Thompson had turned the lights off before he went to bed,
虽然汤普森先生睡觉前把灯关了，

10
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,120
they were on in the morning.
可第二天早上灯却亮着。

11
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:05,240
He also said that he had found five empty whisky bottles
他还说发现了五只空的威士忌酒瓶，

12
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:08,220
which the ghost must have drunk the night before.
这肯定是鬼在前一天晚上喝的。

13
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:17,940
When I suggested that some villagers must have come in for a free drink, Mr.Thompson shook his head.
当我暗示说一定是村民进来喝免费的酒时，汤普森先生摇了摇头。

14
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:24,150
The villagers have told him that they will not accept the pub even if he gives it away.
村民们告诉他，即使他把酒馆白送，他们也不要。
